{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1069", "sample_idx": 34, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "Subject: Invitation to Meeting on Upcoming Project\n\nDear Team Members\n\nI am writing to formally invite you to a meeting that will be held on Friday at 2 PM in the conference room on the second floor of our headquarters building. The purpose of this meeting is to discuss the upcoming project that our team will be working on and to outline the key objectives and milestones that we need to achieve.\n\nAs you are aware our team has been experiencing a significant increase in workload over the past few months and this project is expected to be a major contributor to our overall success. The project involves developing a new product that is correlated with our company's overall business strategy and is expected to drive significant revenue growth.\n\nDuring the meeting we will be discussing the project plan and timeline and outlining the roles and responsibilities of each team member. We will also be reviewing the budget and resources required to complete the project and identifying any potential roadblocks or challenges that we may face.\n\nI would like to encourage all team members to come prepared to the meeting with their ideas and suggestions on how to approach this project. We will be having an open discussion on the best way to move forward and I encourage everyone to participate and share their thoughts.\n\nThe meeting is expected to last for approximately two hours and will cover the following topics. Firstly we will be discussing the project overview and objectives. Secondly we will be reviewing the project plan and timeline. Thirdly we will be outlining the roles and responsibilities of each team member. Fourthly we will be discussing the budget and resources required to complete the project. Finally we will be identifying any potential risks or challenges that we may face and developing a plan to mitigate them.\n\nI believe that this meeting is crucial to the success of our project and I look forward to seeing you all there. Your participation and input are invaluable to the success of this project and I am confident that together we can achieve great things.\n\nIn preparation for the meeting I would like to ask that you review the project proposal document that was sent out earlier this week. This document outlines the key objectives and milestones of the project and provides a detailed overview of the work that needs to be done.\n\nIf you are unable to attend the meeting please let me know as soon as possible so that we can make arrangements for an alternate. I would also appreciate it if you could confirm your attendance by replying to this email.\n\nThe meeting will be held in the conference room on the second floor of our headquarters building. The address is 123 Main Street and the meeting will start at 2 PM sharp. I would like to remind everyone that punctuality is important and I would appreciate it if you could make every effort to be there on time.\n\nI am looking forward to seeing you all on Friday and discussing the project in more detail. Our team is experiencing a period of significant growth and change and I am excited to be a part of it. I am confident that with our combined skills and expertise we can achieve great things and make a real impact on our company's success.\n\nThe project we are about to embark on is a major undertaking and will require a lot of hard work and dedication from all team members. However I am confident that we have the talent and expertise to deliver a high-quality outcome that is correlated with our company's overall business strategy.\n\nThank you for your time and I look forward to seeing you on Friday.\n\nBest regards\nJohn Doe", "logprobs": [{"token": "Subject", "logprob": -0.12692877650260925}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.0030145461205393076}, {"token": " Inv", "logprob": -0.010595849715173244}, {"token": "itation", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token